[3] T. Hastie, R. Tibshirani, and J. Friedman, The Elements of Statistical Learning, 2nd ed. New York, NY, USA: Springer, 2009.
[4] C. M. Bishop, Pattern Recognition and Machine Learning. New York, NY, USA: Springer, 2006.
[5] A. Géron, Hands-On Machine Learning with Scikit-Learn, Keras, and TensorFlow, 2nd ed. Sebastopol, CA, USA: O'Reilly Media, 2019.
